  "description": "观澜 · 落子深度研判预案 — the sealed single-stock ten-seat chain. pv.price_action, pv.technical, pv.microstructure, text.news, text.sentiment and the bounded dec.bull/dec.bear exchange are all blocking typed inputs to dec.research_mgr; its ResearchPlan then feeds dec.pm, and dec.pm's PortfolioDecision feeds the terminal dec.trader. No evidence seat is auxiliary decoration: if any critical seat is absent or non-complete the live wrapper labels the attempt degraded and keeps the fast judgment authoritative. The bull/bear reducer remains a published audit transcript, while the decision-bearing injection uses explicit schema-checked direct inputs. The graph is code-agnostic and byte-frozen; the run-scoped subject carries the evidence timeframe separately from the plan. The clean path remains eight primary LLM calls. The static-runtime-v2 worst case gives pv.technical and text.news one additional explicit primary sampling cycle, with at most one strict schema-validation resample per cycle; all other LLM seats keep one cycle. pv.technical and dec.bear each reserve 65,536 tokens per attempt so the full technical dictionary and the late-speaking bear's four committed evidence blocks both retain the complete 8,192-token completion allowance. Retry/resample headroom is neither an extra agent nor an extra debate round and never weakens JSON or output-schema validation.",
